{"name":"Bella","hex":"#574057","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Bella","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Spoken by a player during a match with one or more visually impaired players to indicate the b-file in algebraic notation."]},{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A female given name from Italian."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Bella"}],"entries":[{"title":"Bella","blocks":[{"text":"Bella is a feminine given name. It is a diminutive or nickname form of names ending in -bella, including Izabella and Isabella. However, it can also derive, unrelatedly, from the Italian, Spanish, Portuguese and (ultimately) Latin words for \"beautiful\". In French, Belle is a name and word meaning beautiful."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bella","wikidata":"Q792453"}],"images":[],"sounds":{},"pictures":[{"title":"Purple Sunset Over Apartments","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/eb/Purple_Sunset_Over_Apartments.jpg/500px-Purple_Sunset_Over_Apartments.jpg","ratio":0.75,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Purple_Sunset_Over_Apartments.jpg","share":0.14},{"title":"Silhouette of an island at dusk with purple sky and clouds in Don Det Si Phan Don Laos","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/56/Silhouette_of_an_island_at_dusk_with_purple_sky_and_clouds_in_Don_Det_Si_Phan_Don_Laos.jpg/500px-Silhouette_of_an_island_at_dusk_with_purple_sky_and_clouds_in_Don_Det_Si_Phan_Don_Laos.jpg","ratio":1.600055819145967,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Silhouette_of_an_island_at_dusk_with_purple_sky_and_clouds_in_Don_Det_Si_Phan_Don_Laos.jpg","share":0.106875},{"title":"Purple rain on roof","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/79/Purple_rain_on_roof.jpg/500px-Purple_rain_on_roof.jpg","ratio":1.5389863547758285,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Purple_rain_on_roof.jpg","share":0.103125},{"title":"Anemone purple anemonefish"